    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market this exceptional four-bedroom three-storey detached residence, standing on an elevated site of approximately 1 acre at Rahard, Hollymount, Co. Mayo.\r\n\r\nOne of the finest properties to come to the market in the area in recent years, this outstanding family home combines generous living accommodation, mature private grounds, excellent outbuildings and superb views over the surrounding countryside.\r\n\r\nThe residence is approached through a secure entrance with modern electric gates and a sweeping curved tarmacadam driveway leading through the mature grounds to the residence, extensive yard, detached garage and substantial workshop.\r\n\r\nMature trees and established hedging provide excellent privacy, while the elevated position takes full advantage of the attractive views across the rolling Mayo countryside.\r\n\r\nThe beautifully presented accommodation extends over three floors and has been thoughtfully designed for modern family living.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor includes a welcoming entrance hallway and reception area, sitting room with feature natural stone fireplace, large maple fitted kitchen and dining area, TV room, utility room, guest WC and a double bedroom.\r\n\r\nThe inclusion of a bedroom at ground-floor level enhances the flexibility of the accommodation, making the property particularly suitable for family living, guests or those seeking the convenience of a downstairs bedroom.\r\n\r\nThe first floor provides three further double bedrooms, including an outstanding master bedroom suite with two walk-in wardrobes, private ensuite and views to both the front and rear of the property.\r\n\r\nDouble doors from the master bedroom provide access to a private balcony overlooking the surrounding countryside.\r\n\r\nAlso located on the first floor is a spacious landing, large walk-in hot press and fully tiled family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe third floor provides developed attic accommodation, including an office/study and additional storage space, offering excellent flexibility for those working from home or requiring further space.\r\n\r\nExternally, the extensive grounds include rolling lawns, mature trees and hedging, a sweeping driveway, large concrete yard, detached garage and substantial workshop/storage building.\r\n\r\nThe workshop is a particularly valuable feature and includes an electric high roller door and gantry crane, making it suitable for a variety of commercial, mechanical, agricultural, hobby or storage uses.\r\n\r\nThe detached garage also offers additional potential and has been designed to allow for the possibility of connecting it directly to the main residence if required, subject to any necessary planning or building requirements.\r\n\r\nThis is a distinctive family home offering an excellent combination of generous accommodation, privacy, mature grounds and extensive external facilities.\r\nOUTSIDE\r\n\r\nThe residence stands on an elevated site of approximately 2 acres, offering excellent privacy and generous outdoor space.\r\n\r\nAn impressive secure entrance with modern electric gates opens onto a sweeping curved tarmacadam driveway leading through the mature grounds to the residence.\r\n\r\nThe property is surrounded by extensive rolling lawns, mature trees, established hedging and landscaped areas.\r\n\r\nA large concrete yard provides extensive parking and circulation space.\r\n\r\nPatio areas provide additional outdoor space for dining, entertaining and relaxation.\r\n\r\nDetached Garage\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from a substantial detached garage offering excellent storage and additional potential.\r\n\r\nThe garage has been designed to allow for the possibility of connecting it directly to the main residence if required, subject to any necessary planning or building requirements.\r\n\r\nWorkshop / Storage Building\r\n\r\nA substantial workshop and storage building represents a particularly valuable feature of the property.\r\n\r\nThe building benefits from an electric high roller door and gantry crane and offers excellent potential for commercial, mechanical, agricultural, hobby or storage purposes.\r\nLOCATION\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys an attractive countryside setting at Rahard, Hollymount, Co. Mayo, combining the benefits of peaceful rural living with convenient access to local amenities and recreational facilities.\r\n\r\nBallinrobe Golf Club is located just minutes from the property, while the popular Lough Carra area is approximately a 10-minute drive away.\r\n\r\nFamilies are particularly well catered for, with school transport services passing the property.\r\n\r\nA nearby primary school also provides crèche and after-school facilities.\r\n\r\nThe combination of a private countryside setting, nearby recreational amenities and convenient school transport services makes this an attractive location for family living.\r\nDisclaimer: Nigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs and information provided are for guidance purposes only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\n\r\nA bright and welcoming entrance hallway and reception area featuring tiled flooring and a striking timber staircase leading to the upper-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nSitting Room\r\n\r\nA beautifully presented family sitting room featuring solid timber flooring and an impressive floor-to-ceiling natural stone fireplace with solid-fuel stove forming the centrepiece of the room.\r\n\r\nThe room enjoys excellent natural light and provides a comfortable principal reception space.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Area\r\n\r\nA generously proportioned kitchen and dining area ideally suited to modern family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen features an extensive range of quality fitted maple units, generous worktop and storage space, display cabinets, integrated wine storage, feature range-style cooker with stainless steel splashback and extractor hood and recessed ceiling lighting.\r\n\r\nThe dining area provides ample space for family dining and entertaining.\r\n\r\nTV Room\r\n\r\nA comfortable additional family living area featuring sliding glazed doors providing excellent natural light and direct access to the outdoor patio area.\r\n\r\nThe direct connection to the patio creates an excellent flow between the indoor and outdoor living spaces.\r\n\r\nBedroom One\r\n\r\nA spacious double bedroom conveniently positioned at ground-floor level.\r\n\r\nThis versatile room is ideal as a guest bedroom, additional family accommodation or for those seeking the convenience of a downstairs bedroom.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n\r\nGenerously proportioned utility room featuring fitted units, extensive storage and space for appliances.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\n\r\nConveniently located ground-floor toilet facilities.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n\r\nA spacious first-floor landing providing access to the bedroom accommodation, family bathroom, walk-in hot press and staircase leading to the upper floor.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom\r\n\r\nAn exceptionally spacious master bedroom suite enjoying attractive views over the surrounding countryside to both the front and rear of the property.\r\n\r\nThe master suite benefits from two separate walk-in wardrobes providing extensive storage accommodation.\r\n\r\nDouble doors provide access to a private balcony, creating an ideal space from which to enjoy the property’s elevated setting and countryside views.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\n\r\nPrivate ensuite facilities serving the master bedroom.\r\n\r\nBedroom Three\r\n\r\nGenerously proportioned double bedroom offering bright and comfortable accommodation.\r\n\r\nBedroom Four\r\n\r\nFurther spacious double bedroom ideally suited to family or guest accommodation.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom\r\n\r\nA large and beautifully presented family bathroom, fully tiled throughout and comprising a large corner bath with shower facilities, WC and contemporary vanity-style wash hand basin with storage.\r\n\r\nThe bathroom enjoys excellent natural light and is finished to a high standard.\r\n\r\nWalk-In Hot Press\r\n\r\nGenerous walk-in hot press providing excellent additional storage space.\r\n\r\nTHIRD FLOOR\r\n\r\nDeveloped Attic Accommodation\r\n\r\nA staircase leads to the developed upper-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nThis highly versatile area includes an office/study together with additional space suitable for home working, hobbies or storage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Exceptional four-bedroom three-storey detached family residence\r\n\r\nStanding on an elevated site of approximately 1 acre\r\n\r\nSuperb views over the surrounding Mayo countryside\r\n\r\nSecure entrance with modern electric gates\r\n\r\nSweeping curved tarmacadam driveway\r\n\r\nMature trees and established hedging providing excellent privacy\r\n\r\nGenerous accommodation extending over three floors\r\n\r\nFour well-proportioned double bedrooms\r\n\r\nOne bedroom conveniently located at ground-floor level\r\n\r\nOutstanding master bedroom suite\r\n\r\nTwo walk-in wardrobes serving the master bedroom\r\n\r\nPrivate master ensuite\r\n\r\nDouble doors opening onto a private balcony\r\n\r\nSpacious sitting room with natural stone fireplace and solid-fuel stove\r\n\r\nLarge maple fitted kitchen and dining area\r\n\r\nSeparate TV room with sliding doors opening onto the patio area\r\n\r\nUtility room and ground-floor guest WC\r\n\r\nLarge fully tiled family bathroom\r\n\r\nWalk-in hot press\r\n\r\nDeveloped upper-floor accommodation with office/study\r\n\r\nOil-fired central heating\r\n\r\nLarge detached garage\r\n\r\nSubstantial workshop and storage building\r\n\r\nElectric high roller door and gantry crane\r\n\r\nExtensive concrete yard and mature private grounds"
